  entity ores_trading_instrument_strikes_tbl <<temporal>> #D8E4F0 {
    * tenant_id : uuid <<PK>>
    * trade_id : uuid <<PK, FK>>
    * valid_from : timestamptz <<PK>>
    * valid_to : timestamptz <<PK>>
    --
    * version : int
    * trade_activity_id : uuid <<FK>>
      price_value : numeric
      price_currency : text
      yield_value : numeric
      yield_compounding : text
      bare_value : numeric
      bare_currency : text
  }
}

note right of ores_trading_rate_instruments_tbl
  The family header. One row per rates trade,
  carrying the coverage check over the family's
  codes and owning the family's rows for the
  delete cascade. The fields every product shares
  are thin because a rates trade has no security:
  a swap's economics are its own, not an issuer's.
end note

note right of ores_trading_swap_legs_tbl
  Re-keyed from a surrogate id to (trade_id,
  leg_number), as bond_legs is keyed by
  (trade_id, leg_role, leg_number). The leg type
  stays data in leg_type_code.
end note

note bottom of ores_trading_swap_leg_amounts_tbl
  The amortisation and step schedules the single
  notional, fixed_rate and spread columns cannot
  hold today.
end note

